# Engine Court hazard test (11-05): spark landing ec_spark1 (shock 2/s, pulse 2 on 3 off) on the tower's first landing. CIPlay engine_court_hurt, in a test world 'CI ...', CIGapsSuit off (no suit: the zone must hurt).
island Engine Court keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
zone ec_spark1
wait 20
expect message Sparks crawl over the landing
# (6 is about half of the expected damage)
expect hurt 6
